bottomparticipants

actor Admin
boundary "Genre Management UI" as UI
boundary Router
control GenreController
control GenreService
entity GenreModel
entity MangaModel
database MongoDB

Admin -> UI: 1. Open Genre Management page
activate Admin
activate UI

UI -> UI: 2. useEffect() call fetchGenres()
activate UI
space
deactivate UI

UI -> Router: 3. GET /genre
activate Router

alt Token invalid
    Router --> UI: 3.1.1. 401 Unauthorized
    UI --> Admin: 3.1.2. Show error message
else Role invalid
    Router --> UI: 3.2.1. 403 Forbidden
    UI --> Admin: 3.2.2. Show error message
end
    Router -> GenreController: 4. getAllGenres()
    activate GenreController

    GenreController -> GenreService: 5. getAllGenres()
    activate GenreService

    GenreService -> GenreModel: 6. find().sort({name:1})
    activate GenreModel
    GenreModel -> MongoDB: 7. query genres
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> GenreModel: 8. genres[]
    deactivate MongoDB
    GenreModel --> GenreService: 9. genres[]
    deactivate GenreModel

    GenreService -> MangaModel: 10. aggregate(unwind + group count)
    activate MangaModel
    MangaModel -> MongoDB: 11. run aggregate
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> MangaModel: 12. counts[]
    deactivate MongoDB
    MangaModel --> GenreService: 13. counts[]
    deactivate MangaModel

    GenreService -> GenreService: 14. Merge counts, genres
    activate GenreService
    space
    deactivate GenreService
    
    GenreService --> GenreController: 15. genresWithStoriesCount[]
    deactivate GenreService

    GenreController --> Router: 16. HTTP 200 response
    deactivate GenreController
    Router --> UI: 17. Return genres list
    deactivate Router

    UI --> Admin: 18. Display genres with storiesCount

deactivate UI
deactivate Admin